[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2869658095","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106263#issuecomment-2869658095","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106263","id":2869658095,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rC4Hv","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-11T09:41:10Z","updated_at":"2025-05-11T22:43:28Z","body":"Admittedly this is lot of API for a relatively simple change. I'm curious what others think about using the `set_font_color_override_all()` and `set_font_color_override(State p_state)` convention instead, perhaps using the `Button.DRAW_PRESSED` enum or just making a new enum that doesn't have a `PRESSED_HOVER` option for clarity (because the TabBar does not support pressed and hover styles at the same time). The current method names might be a bit long but I also think that they accurately convey the use of the method.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2869658095/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2870425427","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106263#issuecomment-2870425427","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106263","id":2870425427,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rFzdT","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-12T00:49:48Z","updated_at":"2025-05-17T23:58:46Z","body":"I reduced the size of the API from eight to the three functions seen below:\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends TabContainer\r\n\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n    var color = get_tab_bar().get_font_color_override(BaseButton.DRAW_DISABLED, 3)\r\n    get_tab_bar().set_font_color_override(BaseButton.DRAW_PRESSED, 0, Color.DEEP_PINK)\r\n    get_tab_bar().set_font_color_override_all(2, Color.YELLOW)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis should hopefully make it easier to use, and behind the scenes it is neater, using an array of Colors instead of individual variables. Feedback is welcome on the specific enum used.\r\n\r\nAnother option would be to have a `TabBar::DrawMode` enum with the same values but without the `DRAW_PRESSED_HOVER` value. I do worry that this would be too repetitive though.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2870425427/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888685472","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106263#issuecomment-2888685472","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106263","id":2888685472,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sLdeg","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-18T00:58:50Z","updated_at":"2025-05-18T00:58:50Z","body":"I updated to use a `TabBar::DrawMode` enum. I also swapped the order of the arguments, so that the tab index is always first.\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends TabContainer\r\n\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n    var color = get_tab_bar().get_font_color_override(0, TabBar.DRAW_DISABLED)\r\n    get_tab_bar().set_font_color_override(1, TabBar.DRAW_PRESSED, Color.DEEP_PINK)\r\n    get_tab_bar().set_font_color_override_all(2, Color.YELLOW)\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888685472/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888979834","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106263#issuecomment-2888979834","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106263","id":2888979834,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sMlV6","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-18T13:06:27Z","updated_at":"2025-05-18T13:06:27Z","body":"While I somewhat like the new API, for the purpose of coloring bottom panel you only need `DRAW_NORMAL`. Currently the buttons display the default pressed and hover colors.\r\n\r\nAl